---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "@/components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import Prose from "@/components/Prose.astro";
import PuneWebsiteCostCalculator from "@/components/tools/PuneWebsiteCostCalculator";
---

<Layout
  title="Maharashtra & Pune Website Development Cost Calculator 2026 | NextReach Studio"
  description="Estimate website development costs across top Maharashtra cities: Pune, Mumbai, Nagpur, Nashik, Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar, and Kolhapur. Compare real 2026 agency pricing benchmarks, tech stacks, and timelines."
  canonicalURL="https://www.nextreachstudio.in/tools/pune-website-cost-calculator/"
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="container-page">
    <header class="header-page animate-fade-in-up">
      <p class="header-page-pretitle">Free Maharashtra Business Tool</p>
      <h1 class="header-page-title">Maharashtra Website Cost Calculator</h1>
      <p class="header-page-subtitle">
        Compare realistic 2026 website development and design costs across Pune, Mumbai, Nagpur, Nashik, Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar, and Kolhapur. Calculate upfront build costs, annual operations, and tech architecture risks.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="my-6">
      <PuneWebsiteCostCalculator client:load />
    </div>

    <section class="mt-16">
      <Prose>
        <h2>Average Website Development Costs Across Maharashtra (2026)</h2>
        <p>
          Website development costs vary significantly across Maharashtra depending on commercial overhead, local talent supply, and agency business models:
        </p>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto my-6">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>City Market</th>
                <th>Starter Site (3-5 pgs)</th>
                <th>Commercial Site (6-12 pgs)</th>
                <th>E-Commerce Store</th>
                <th>Custom Web App / MVP</th>
                <th>Local Market Trait</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Mumbai (MMR)</strong></td>
                <td>₹30,000 – ₹50,000</td>
                <td>₹60,000 – ₹1,20,000</td>
                <td>₹85,000 – ₹2,00,000</td>
                <td>₹2,20,000 – ₹6,00,000+</td>
                <td>High metro retainers; agency rents in BKC/Lower Parel</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Pune (PCMC & City)</strong></td>
                <td>₹20,000 – ₹35,000</td>
                <td>₹35,000 – ₹65,000</td>
                <td>₹55,000 – ₹1,20,000</td>
                <td>₹1,50,000 – ₹4,50,000</td>
                <td>Engineering sweet spot; strong tech talent, modern stacks</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Nagpur</strong></td>
                <td>₹18,000 – ₹30,000</td>
                <td>₹30,000 – ₹55,000</td>
                <td>₹45,000 – ₹95,000</td>
                <td>₹1,30,000 – ₹3,80,000</td>
                <td>Growing MIHAN logistics and tech corridor demand</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Nashik</strong></td>
                <td>₹16,000 – ₹28,000</td>
                <td>₹28,000 – ₹50,000</td>
                <td>₹42,000 – ₹90,000</td>
                <td>₹1,20,000 – ₹3,50,000</td>
                <td>Industrial MIDC catalogues, wine tourism & agribusiness</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Chh. Sambhajinagar</strong></td>
                <td>₹16,000 – ₹28,000</td>
                <td>₹28,000 – ₹50,000</td>
                <td>₹42,000 – ₹90,000</td>
                <td>₹1,20,000 – ₹3,50,000</td>
                <td>Auto & pharma manufacturing B2B export specifications</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Kolhapur</strong></td>
                <td>₹14,000 – ₹25,000</td>
                <td>₹25,000 – ₹45,000</td>
                <td>₹38,000 – ₹85,000</td>
                <td>₹1,10,000 – ₹3,20,000</td>
                <td>Foundry, textile & sugar trade; high template prevalence</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <h2>Why Maharashtra Businesses Choose Pune Engineering Studios</h2>
        <p>
          Companies in Mumbai frequently pay ₹80,000 to ₹1,50,000 for standard WordPress websites simply because the agency maintains offices in Lower Parel or BKC. Conversely, businesses in industrial hubs like Nashik, Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar, and Kolhapur often struggle to find local developers who build on modern performance frameworks like Astro or React.
        </p>
        <p>
          Pune represents Maharashtra's software engineering sweet spot: mature developer talent from Hinjewadi and Kharadi tech corridors, direct access to senior software architects, and fixed-price contracts without Mumbai's 40% commercial overhead markup.
        </p>

        <h2>Read the Complete Financial Analysis</h2>
        <p>
          For a deep line-by-line breakdown of what each price point buys, the hidden costs of cheap template agencies, and how AI has impacted quotes, read our complete guide:
          <a href="/blog/website-design-cost-pune-2026/">Website Design & Development Cost in Pune 2026: Complete Pricing Breakdown</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Get a Transparent Fixed-Scope Proposal</h2>
        <p>
          Whether you operate in Mumbai, Pune, Nagpur, or Nashik, NextReach Studio delivers sub-second, custom-engineered web platforms with verified 100/100 Core Web Vitals. Talk directly with an engineer:
          <a href="/contact/">Schedule a technical discovery call</a>.
        </p>
      </Prose>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
